      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f166c1009e78b44b171b9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢啦，辛苦咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef3053c369e33699e5b80522ca50daaaf3eddc121f27acada39f6f417765fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8732058e565187b8a7848e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天有作战计划吗？\r\n尽管吩咐吧，\r\n一切交给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ba43430c1999bf709f8b3ce01ebd40b6448e6782bcb190e869ca3f3de67cfb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d31be0400a9ba7f1ae015aea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢呼声好夸张喔，真搞笑。\r\n不过，倒是不会让你们失望喔。\r\n我立刻就过去，再等一下啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1f97d2067b02e530123fdd93ba42d34310a1744bbdf8d2805bc4617d10e5e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53f18a2a657841091b7e7ed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢啦，辛苦咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef3053c369e33699e5b80522ca50daaaf3eddc121f27acada39f6f417765fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf97fb31186aa3e4f8db0cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぇーい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd5af7642ef848360f9fc83b8b262714c5fec7128704b182f124593a3a08de7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b10b86c8e4546f435c0f7773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太可惜了……不过下次会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e248bca49120a25158844fbdeabde65c12777b065041f957698c6165a0391b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c42f88929ff833badc47673c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这点程度才无法满足我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c4f209433a2bd8bd01e3b48992e183cc481f10caacb33812a70c5ae2983ef1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf9d694e1544ad2b86fdee0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶……！我可以再跑得更好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b47c53057c7e23214e4a3269f84430722c808f1125a0ccb305b77aca64844fd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b19aabf1eb1d22ff818670",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──啊，超逊的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8617e6443a2d733729d637a5847ec1371463290c589b53a27e2a856a4034672e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e33683f1a52fef3a4612207",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈☆这个绝对会爆红的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb7d2ce208a4c9aef54b140a7a88e5748a4c9498cb92d18d1f2818b606f4c61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e80b5a0db0167b3f2b03980e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……啊，欧耶☆有好好嗨起来呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "17a10d0c4d76bc0f55e60482e614e77351d558730cbff0dc78f599643084d8d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c689a1bf6b1cafdb9434eb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是比赛或穿搭，\r\n都是我最强☆的感觉～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f06de85463f4c65804a755eb3371f7339ab2f15c827f5814ea1806ff5a16775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e00b424b829bd6584d2c4023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……啊，喔耶☆有好好嗨起来呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2413492d3419d1e75c2cf228a29de6787894ed11f9c96ab369f4446d284b22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc2e71139df9caef11c272c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我看仔细咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5de502bf67c9ffb128a56b2b50bc2ec2adc1e26d2b0400a00c8aaa30bba8ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c098757b6b23d3676535a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是要拿出全力了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d5ca771a885c0219b8d91f3574fc3b3e40b18eb6627eb332757bae9ef19095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43eb98b1ca1159189a3400a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏季踏青太棒了！Fu♪\r\n真的幸好不用补考！\r\n来拍个一万张照片吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "81573f7786298da2f7eee5a78931958465fbfc627f5ce145e111a5813d3bb8b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0346f5b0cd8f19ad910adbbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……好想找奖券藏。看到那个人\r\n做什么都卯足全力，我就觉得\r\n全都无所谓了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc207818d8ab200fbb9a0bf2934dfbbc4c452bbac72ac224041b7c0c03d8afa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3642203d73e12fc0114385ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嘿嘿，美甲会让人嗨起来对吧？\r\n这个我可是有点自信的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b930620bdeb401ac736c97b2bf363bd582f2c04e31eec2007ddeddc8049321",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ee97d17a16d6fcb569362a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上传哪张到UG呢～？\r\n和城市的合照会让大家爆嗨……\r\n别放那张好了……毕竟很重要嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea7c38309b4072df2100035edd300cc1f6c8947a34f7f9fe26c2311e13e0c5d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4396da6c2b75bd1dee222cae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯？啊。啊哈☆决胜颜色，\r\n果然要选这个吧～！\r\n欧耶──！呵呵，要做好心理准备喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b26b8a78a252a23b5f98f8a6d33c79743d4457939965514d0388eb0c9ca8607",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4685f75dd19521d460e4eb69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "度假胜地太强啦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b490b7260342f0e37743999aba923eaf5bca3b9d0806ffe36f8e6709387904d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397591d7ec871e9ceed0a9e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "追踪者们阿啰哈～♪我来度假啰♪\r\n从哭哭！到喔耶☆再投篮！\r\n夏天果然？是最强的～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9c5e969aa83e6c0969f8543bce7e4b101d242c9b1a663232bd04ca7793f6cb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7da5cefe928169fafeb2c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b33a254fab11bd5c13f77a29969e0a73f385063bb77b92a7f940b8106c726ed7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5cc3fc053805a44aa59dbb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6e8ddf78ab96962ce0d078439426606da213fa68482b193399045a60f7c142",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
